==Strategy==
This stage shouldn't pose much of a threat at all as Blitzen isn't even at 100% strength magnification and the supporting enemies drop plenty of cash. Simply bring [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and spam it alongside meatshields for an easy victory.

